WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.180
Rethink how you recycle.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.080
Soft plastics that can be scrunched in your hand,

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.740
go in the rubbish.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.080
Along with all lids and tops.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:16.240
Find out more at rethinkrubbish.co.nz

